WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.560 --> 00:00:08.160
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today I am going to&nbsp;
explain an American prison comedy film called “Big&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:08.160 --> 00:00:20.000
Stan”. Spoilers ahead! Watch out and take care!
Stan Minton is a real estate agent living in LA,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:28.000
who has everything he wants in life; he is filthy&nbsp;
rich and has a beautiful wife Mindy who he loves.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.760
Stan has a unique way of selling properties to his&nbsp;
clients. He usually cheats them of a small amount&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:40.080
which has over the years grown large. Hence,&nbsp;
one day, he is arrested for first-degree fraud.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:40.080 --> 00:00:45.280
He is found guilty and is told that he will get&nbsp;
a sentence of at least three years in prison.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:51.040
Desperate to find a way out, he asks his lawyer to&nbsp;
bribe the judge. The lawyer does as told but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:57.680
conviction is absolute. By faking a charity event,&nbsp;
he only manages to get Stan six months free time&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:57.680 --> 00:01:02.880
before being imprisoned. After the hearing,&nbsp;
the lawyer suggests Stan take a long trip&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:09.120
to Brazil to never return. But he cannot do&nbsp;
so because all his assets have been frozen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:09.120 --> 00:01:14.480
Stan has no way but to live the next few&nbsp;
months in fear of what is about to come.
&nbsp;

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:18.960
Starting that day, he does everything quicker&nbsp;
because of the limited time. One evening,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:24.480
he is on a date with Mindy who wants to have a&nbsp;
kid so she won’t be alone when he is gone. Stan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:29.600
thinks the idea is absurd because they will have&nbsp;
to give up the kid for adoption when he returns.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:34.960
He dreads the idea of having children which&nbsp;
creates a rift in his relationship with his wife.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:34.960 --> 00:01:40.800
Mindy storms off after his comment while Stan&nbsp;
drives to a bar at random. While drinking, he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:46.720
notices a man beside him with a tattoo about going&nbsp;
to prison. He asks the guy for tips on prison&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.720 --> 00:01:51.680
life and offers him a hundred bucks to talk.
The man starts by saying that the prison guards&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:56.400
do not care about the inmates and their fights.&nbsp;
The prisoners could kill each other but as long&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:56.400 --> 00:02:01.440
as they don’t escape they let you do anything.&nbsp;
He also adds that Stan looks like someone who&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:01.440 --> 00:02:06.480
would most definitely be sexually violated by&nbsp;
the inmates. Stan realizes that all the rumors&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:11.840
about men turning gay in prison are true.&nbsp;
He is weak and submissive which makes him&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:17.040
the perfect target. When the man suggests he&nbsp;
get several tattoos to avoid being targeted,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:22.880
Stan shows him a tattoo of his mother on his arm&nbsp;
which clearly won’t work. The man then advises&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:28.640
him to join one of the groups in the prison. The&nbsp;
groups are mostly divided into Nazis, racists,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:28.640 --> 00:02:33.760
Mexican men, and African American men. But since&nbsp;
Stan doesn’t fit in any of those categories,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:33.760 --> 00:02:38.000
his last resort is to kill someone so&nbsp;
the inmates would be scared of him. 
&nbsp;

00:02:38.000 --> 00:02:43.360
The following morning, he wakes up with a hangover&nbsp;
and thinks that he was dreaming. He is distressed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:43.360 --> 00:02:48.560
when Mindy tells him he is still going to prison.&nbsp;
To uplift him, she mentions his special quality&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:53.840
is that he always finds a way. This encourages&nbsp;
Stan and he makes it his mission to become an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:53.840 --> 00:03:00.480
alpha in the next six months. Starting the next&nbsp;
day exercises every day and gets a tattoo on his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.332
behind to make it less attractive. One night, Stan&nbsp;
asks Mindy to use a sex toy on him so even if the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:02.332 --> 00:03:04.400
inmates try to take advantage of him, he would&nbsp;
be accustomed to it. He also joins a karate class&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:04.400 --> 00:03:09.200
but is bored when asked to learn the basics. He&nbsp;
challenges the teacher and gets in a fight with&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:09.200 --> 00:03:14.720
one of the kids which results in him being thrown&nbsp;
out of the establishment. This is when he meets an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:21.040
old man named The Master. He impresses Stan by&nbsp;
breaking a hole in the wall with no effort.
&nbsp;

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:26.560
He is Stan’s only hope to learn self-defense&nbsp;
before going to prison. Hence, he brings the old&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:26.560 --> 00:03:31.440
man home to train with him. The Master starts&nbsp;
living with them, much to Mindy’s annoyance.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:37.280
On his first day of training, Stan is woken up at&nbsp;
five in the morning by blood from an animal liver&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:43.280
pouring on his face. Then, the master makes&nbsp;
Mindy blend ox pancreas and horse tongues to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:43.280 --> 00:03:48.880
make a smoothie for her husband. His way of&nbsp;
training is different and over the top, some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:54.240
days he hits Stan with a flaming stick, while the&nbsp;
other days he hangs him by his skin to test his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:54.240 --> 00:04:00.720
endurance. He also feeds Stan a variety of weird&nbsp;
food like scorpions and snakes. Mindy, who is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:06.320
tired of the master smoking all around the house,&nbsp;
asks her husband to get rid of him. That night,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:06.320 --> 00:04:11.600
Stan pretends that they are being robbed and makes&nbsp;
Mindy think she is about to be sexually assaulted.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.600 --> 00:04:16.640
It turns out he is doing this to make her feel&nbsp;
what he is feeling. When Mindy stops panicking,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:20.880
she packs her luggage and leaves, claiming that&nbsp;
she doesn’t want to be with him anymore.
&nbsp;

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:26.880
The Master is delighted that she left because&nbsp;
with only men in the house, the training can get&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.880 --> 00:04:33.120
tougher. For the next five months, Stan works hard&nbsp;
without resting. By the end of it, he manages to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:38.480
take the master by surprise in combat. For&nbsp;
his last test, he goes to fight the karate&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:38.480 --> 00:04:44.320
teacher who once threw him out of his class. Stan&nbsp;
defeats the man easily and completes his training.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:44.320 --> 00:04:49.200
He is finally ready to defend himself when he&nbsp;
needs to. The master and the lawyer drop him off&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:49.200 --> 00:04:54.720
at the court. Mindy has still not talked to him&nbsp;
but she watches him secretly from inside her car.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:54.720 --> 00:05:00.880
Stan finally goes inside and is transported to&nbsp;
the prison on a bus. Immediately, a guy tries&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:00.880 --> 00:05:05.520
to touch him inappropriately but Stan teaches&nbsp;
him a lesson. At the prison, they are welcomed&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:05.520 --> 00:05:10.640
by warden Gasque who kindly asks them to not&nbsp;
trouble the guards, but other than that, they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.640 --> 00:05:15.280
can do anything they please to each other. 
During the cavity check, the new inmates are asked&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.280 --> 00:05:20.880
to strip and bend over. The guards are horrified&nbsp;
to see Stan’s behind that he has modified to make&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:20.880 --> 00:05:26.720
it look unpleasant. Following the cavity check,&nbsp;
he goes to his cell and meets his roommate Larry.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.720 --> 00:05:31.760
To assert his dominance, he asks Larry to get&nbsp;
to the lower bunk. Later, Larry tells him about&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:36.880
the prison squads who have basically formed a&nbsp;
gang. The first gang is a group of black men,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:43.360
the second one is a team of Mexican thugs, the&nbsp;
third one is Nazis, and the fourth one is racists.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:49.120
Then, there is a group of scientists who are great&nbsp;
at killing people by talking too much. Lastly,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:54.240
he is introduced to the most dangerous sexual&nbsp;
predator of the block; Big Raymond. 
&nbsp;

00:05:54.240 --> 00:05:59.120
Raymond is terrorizing a new inmate when Stan&nbsp;
approaches him and challenges him in front of&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:59.120 --> 00:06:04.000
everyone. They get into a fight where Stan uses&nbsp;
self-defense techniques taught by the master&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.000 --> 00:06:08.400
to beat him easily. Impressed by his&nbsp;
skills, the leader of the nazi group,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:08.400 --> 00:06:13.520
Patterson tries to invite him to their&nbsp;
team but Stan beats him up as well.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:18.640
Then, he is approached by the African American&nbsp;
team who are furious that he fought Big Raymond.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:18.640 --> 00:06:24.080
Stan tries to avoid the fight claiming that he is&nbsp;
also black. However, the leader orders his team&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:24.080 --> 00:06:29.920
to attack, and a fight breaks. The guards enjoy&nbsp;
the show while Stan defeats them efficiently. 
&nbsp;

00:06:29.920 --> 00:06:34.960
After the commotion, the entire prison is afraid&nbsp;
of Stan. People make way for him everywhere he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:34.960 --> 00:06:41.200
goes. They all establish him as the alpha of the&nbsp;
prison and call him Big Stan. A young guy named&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:46.480
Robbie who he saved from Raymond earlier comes&nbsp;
to thank him. But Stan dismisses him, claiming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:46.480 --> 00:06:52.000
that he didn’t fight those guys for anyone other&nbsp;
than himself. Later, Warden Gasque calls Stan to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:57.360
his office and reveals that he pushed some buttons&nbsp;
to get Stan in this specific prison. It turns out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:57.360 --> 00:07:02.480
that Gasque is planning to take over the prison&nbsp;
property and build an estate. Since Stan is an&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:02.480 --> 00:07:07.840
experienced realtor, he wants his help to find&nbsp;
out any flaw in the documents relating to it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:07.840 --> 00:07:14.000
In turn for his help, Stan is offered to be freed&nbsp;
only after a year of imprisonment. The idea piques&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:14.000 --> 00:07:19.760
his interest and he agrees to help. He asks Gasque&nbsp;
how he is going to get rid of the prison, but the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:24.080
warden wants to keep that part a secret.
In the meantime, the groups of inmates have&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:24.080 --> 00:07:29.520
joined hands to teach Stan a lesson. While he is&nbsp;
showering one day, Patterson attacks him with a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:29.520 --> 00:07:35.280
knife made out of a melted toothbrush and a razor&nbsp;
blade. In turn, Stan brings out his nunchaku made&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:35.280 --> 00:07:40.800
of soap bars and a shoelace. He easily beats&nbsp;
Patterson up and sends him to the hospital.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:40.800 --> 00:07:46.000
Stan misses his wife desperately and wants to&nbsp;
meet her. He contacts his lawyer to see if she&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:46.000 --> 00:07:51.440
has sent him the divorce papers. To his relief,&nbsp;
she hasn’t yet. After that, he begins to work&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:56.400
on the warden’s project. He is introduced&nbsp;
to a Vietnamese mafia-turned politician,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:56.400 --> 00:08:01.440
Dang who is Gasque’s partner on the project&nbsp;
and is helping him sabotage the prison.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:01.440 --> 00:08:05.520
Stan overhears them talking about their plan&nbsp;
to get rid of the prison from the property.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:05.520 --> 00:08:10.080
He finds out that they are about to make the&nbsp;
inmates fight each other so the guards shoot some&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:14.800
of them. That way, the board of governors will&nbsp;
have to consider closing the prison altogether&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:14.800 --> 00:08:20.080
because it is not being managed properly.
Stan feels like it is his responsibility to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:20.080 --> 00:08:24.800
the inmates even though they want to kill him.&nbsp;
The following day, he arranges a meeting to set&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:30.000
some rules and boundaries in the prison. Firstly,&nbsp;
he throws away all their violent video games and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:35.680
movies because they are a bad influence. Then,&nbsp;
he declares sexual assault as a punishable crime;&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:35.680 --> 00:08:41.520
anyone who does it has to answer to him directly.&nbsp;
When the men whine, he asks them to be involved in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:41.520 --> 00:08:46.560
consensual homosexual sex instead. The concept&nbsp;
is new to them but they agree to do it anyway.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:46.560 --> 00:08:51.440
During the next lunch break, Robbie and some men&nbsp;
approach Stan’s table and thank him for making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:51.440 --> 00:08:57.280
the no assault rules. Stan tries to pass it off as&nbsp;
him asserting dominance but Robbie knows that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:57.280 --> 00:09:02.400
cares about their well-being. At another table,&nbsp;
Big Raymond and his new boyfriend can be seen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:06.640
enjoying a meal together. They are in a happy&nbsp;
homosexual relationship, thanks to Stan. 
&nbsp;

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:11.200
Robbie and his group, along with Big Raymond&nbsp;
and his boyfriend, join Stan’s group.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.200 --> 00:09:16.640
After that, Stan is given a letter addressed to&nbsp;
him by Mindy. He had written to her apologizing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:21.600
for doing what he did and now, she wants&nbsp;
to meet him. Over the next couple of days,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:26.960
if anyone gets into an argument, they come to Stan&nbsp;
to solve it. Eventually, everyone starts liking&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:33.120
each other and living in harmony. One day, Mindy&nbsp;
comes to visit Stan, and the two make love. At the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:33.120 --> 00:09:38.400
same time, Gasque is informed about what Stan has&nbsp;
been up to. The man is furious at him for solving&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:38.400 --> 00:09:43.360
the inmate’s conflicts. Stan is dragged away in&nbsp;
the middle of his special time with Mindy. 
&nbsp;

00:09:43.360 --> 00:09:47.840
Gasque calls him out for trying to sabotage&nbsp;
his plan and threatens to make Dang&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:47.840 --> 00:09:52.800
kill him if he doesn’t follow their orders.&nbsp;
The following day, Stan calls his lawyer to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:58.080
ask for his opinion. The lawyer suggests he&nbsp;
do as told because Gasque is a powerful man.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:58.080 --> 00:10:02.880
After the call, Stan tells everyone that their&nbsp;
problem is not his responsibility and they can&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:08.400
go back to how they were before he came to the&nbsp;
prison. Soon, the fights start to break out again.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:08.400 --> 00:10:13.920
Robbie approaches Stan in the cafeteria but he&nbsp;
throws the poor guy’s plate to ask him to go away.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:13.920 --> 00:10:19.600
Even Larry is disappointed in him. He tries to&nbsp;
walk away but Stan stops him and asks him to stay&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:19.600 --> 00:10:25.120
away from the metal fence at noon. Larry realizes&nbsp;
that Stan is being forced into doing something he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:30.240
doesn’t want to do. He tells all other inmates&nbsp;
about this and they start to plan something.
&nbsp;

00:10:30.240 --> 00:10:35.520
Meanwhile, Gasque arranges a meeting between&nbsp;
Stan and the parole board to discuss his early&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:35.520 --> 00:10:40.560
release. While he is in the meeting, Gasque shows&nbsp;
the board of governors around the prison. He plans&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:46.000
to execute the plan at noon near the fence. Since&nbsp;
most of the inmates get into conflicts at noon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:50.560
he wants to take the opportunity to kill some&nbsp;
of them while the board members witness it.
&nbsp;

00:10:50.560 --> 00:10:55.920
Stan pretends to be a horrible person in front of&nbsp;
the parole board to get out of the room and alert&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:55.920 --> 00:11:02.000
the others to not go near the fence. He is stopped&nbsp;
by Dang who reveals that he has also been trained&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:07.600
by the Master. They get into an intense fight.&nbsp;
Initially, Dang is proven to be more skilled but&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:12.560
Stan takes the lead and knocks Dang out. By&nbsp;
this time, the inmates have already gathered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:12.560 --> 00:11:16.960
in the field with weapons. The guards get&nbsp;
ready to shoot them but to their surprise,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:22.720
the inmates perform a dance number in a Mexican&nbsp;
song. A frustrated Gasque snatches a gun and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:28.640
fires randomly. The board sees this and is ready&nbsp;
to take action against him. Before going down,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:34.560
Gasque wants to kill Stan but he is saved by&nbsp;
Mindy. It is revealed that she had been training&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:40.000
with the Master for the past six months. 
The scene cuts to three years later. Stan has&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:40.000 --> 00:11:45.520
finally completed his prison time and is returning&nbsp;
home. His fellow inmates wish them goodbye and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:45.520 --> 00:11:56.000
Patterson even gets a tattoo of his face on his&nbsp;
belly. Mindy and the master come to pick him up&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:56.000 --> 00:12:00.400
with his three-year-old daughter. 
